        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Limitations of the Study - Slides 39-40</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    width: 900px;\n    margin: 20px auto;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .topnav {\n    display: flex;\n    background: #2b3a67;\n    color: #d9dee8;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .topnav .item {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 14px 0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .topnav .item.active {\n    background: #3d4f8a;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    clip-path: polygon(3% 0, 97% 0, 100% 50%, 97% 100%, 3% 100%, 0% 50%);\n  }\n  .heading {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin: 18px 0 10px 30px;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 0 40px 20px 40px;\n  }\n  .item-b {\n    color: #c00000;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 10px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .item-b .label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 20px;\n  }\n  ul.sub {\n    list-style-type: disc;\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 40px;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  ul.sub li {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .arrow-line {\n    color: #2b3a67;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    margin: 14px 0 8px 15px;\n  }\n  ol.lettered {\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 45px;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #222;\n    list-style-type: lower-alpha;\n  }\n  ol.lettered li {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  ul.check {\n    list-style-type: none;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 25px;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  ul.check li {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  ul.check li::before {\n    content: \"\\2713\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .bottomnav {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 10px 30px 5px 30px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #b5b5b5;\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .bottomnav .bitem {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .bottomnav .bitem.active {\n    color: #333;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #2b3a67;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    max-width: 90px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .pagenum {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 20px;\n    top: 12px;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  b.inline-bold {\n    color: #000;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"topnav\">\n    <div class=\"item\">Novelty &amp; Significance</div>\n    <div class=\"item active\">Limitations of the Study</div>\n    <div class=\"item\">Future Work</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"heading\">Limitations</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"item-b\"><span class=\"label\">b.</span>Approximately 25% of enrolled patients were unable to proceed to vaccination:</div>\n    <ul class=\"sub\">\n      <li>The majority due to either disease progression or inability to generate vaccines because of <b class=\"inline-bold\">low tumor content in the biopsy samples or a low number of mutations.</b></li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"arrow-line\">&rarr; Opportunities to mitigate this issue include:</div>\n    <ol class=\"lettered\">\n      <li>Acceleration of vaccine production timelines</li>\n      <li>Incorporation of potentially higher-yield tumor sampling approaches</li>\n      <li>Selection of alternative clinical settings can be envisioned</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottomnav\">\n    <div class=\"bitem\">Background</div>\n    <div class=\"bitem\">Study Design</div>\n    <div class=\"bitem\">Result</div>\n    <div class=\"bitem active\">Conclusion</div>\n    <div class=\"pagenum\">39</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"topnav\">\n    <div class=\"item\">Novelty &amp; Significance</div>\n    <div class=\"item active\">Limitations of the Study</div>\n    <div class=\"item\">Future Work</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"heading\">Limitations</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"item-b\"><span class=\"label\">c.</span>It is unclear whether pre-vaccine nivolumab contributed to vaccine-induced T cell responses:</div>\n    <ul class=\"sub\">\n      <li>Major pathologic responses were noted post-vaccination melanoma patients who did not initially respond to nivolumab.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"arrow-line\">&rarr; Refining the sequence of different agents in combination immunotherapy for best clinical outcomes needs further study.</div>\n    <ul class=\"check\">\n      <li>Alternative immunoncologic agents, such as anti-CTLA-4, that can preferentially expand naive CD8+ T cells to increase the T cell pool for vaccine priming, might be better a choice for pre-vaccine immunotherapy.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottomnav\">\n    <div class=\"bitem\">Background</div>\n    <div class=\"bitem\">Study Design</div>\n    <div class=\"bitem\">Result</div>\n    <div class=\"bitem active\">Conclusion</div>\n    <div class=\"pagenum\">40</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
